  "docref": "See https://zeldawiki.wiki/w/api.php for API usage. Subscribe to the mediawiki-api-announce mailing list at \u0026lt;https://lists.wikimedia.org/postorius/lists/mediawiki-api-announce.lists.wikimedia.org/\u0026gt; for notice of API deprecations and breaking changes."
}
