-- stdout-mediawiki-error.golden --
## Weekly patrol report
Error:
```
Error executing API:RecentChanges query: 
- Incorrect parameter - mutually exclusive values may not be supplied.
```
-- stdout-success.golden --
## Weekly patrol report
Unpatrolled edits are expiring soon:
- 1 in the next hour
- 2 in the next 24 hours
- 2 in the next day
- 3 in the next 7 days
- 3 in the next week
- 4 in the next 2 weeks
Link to patrol backlog: <$MOCK_SERVER_URL/wiki/Special:RecentChanges?reviewStatus=unpatrolled&limit=1000&days=30&urlversion=2>

